### ====================================================================
### MULTI-TENANT QA SERVICE & RAG REST API ENDPOINTS
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client / Postman
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = S-NET

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. TENANT MANAGEMENT (POSTGRESQL)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Companies / Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants

### Create a New Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "AcmeCorp",
  "name": "Acme Corporation Support",
  "description": "Global SaaS and Cloud Services Customer Support"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PDF UPLOAD, MARKDOWN CONVERSION & RAG INDEXING
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Upload Guideline PDF (Converts to Markdown & Indexes into Vector DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/upload-pdf
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_guideline.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample_guideline.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Converted Lossless Markdown (.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/markdown

### Get Parsed Criteria JSON (Categories, Weights, Line Items, Auto-Fails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/criteria

### Get Vector DB Knowledge Chunks (RAG Policies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/policies

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. LIVE MULTI-TENANT QA EVALUATION (RAG + GEMMA + SCORING)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Evaluate Compliant Call Transcript
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "Alex",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Client: Hello, my internet has been completely down since this morning!\n[00:05] Agent: Thank you for calling S-NET Communications. My name is Alex, how can I help you today?\n[00:12] Client: The router light is red and blinking. My account name is John Doe at 104 Main St.\n[00:18] Agent: Thank you for confirming, John. Let me check the line status and run a remote test right now.\n[00:25] Agent: I can see a line fault on our side. Since you rent the router from us, I will arrange a technician visit at no extra cost to you.\n[00:40] Client: That sounds great, thank you so much!\n[00:45] Agent: You are very welcome. I will transfer you to our quick 1-question survey. Thank you for Choosing S-NET and have a great day."
}

### Evaluate Auto-Fail Call Transcript (Profanity / Avoidance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "BadAgent",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Client: Why was I charged an extra $60 fee on my internet bill this month?\n[00:05] Agent: You probably didn't read your contract properly.\n[00:10] Client: Excuse me? I want to speak to your supervisor right now.\n[00:15] Agent: Supervisors do not take these calls. You are better off just hanging up.\n[00:22] Client: This is outrageous! I am canceling my service.\n[00:28] Agent: Whatever, get lost then."
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. AUDIT & EVALUATION HISTORY
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Past QA Evaluations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations?tenant_id={{tenantId}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ORIGINAL LEGACY ENDPOINTS (STILL SUPPORTED)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Synchronous /analyze
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "[00:00] Agent: Thank you for calling S-NET Communications. My name is Alex, how can I help you today?\n[00:05] Client: I was charged twice this month.\n[00:10] Agent: I apologize, I will refund the charge immediately.\n[00:20] Agent: Thank you for Choosing S-NET and have a great day."
}

### Get Queue Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/queue

### Get Scoring Weights
GET {{baseUrl}}/weights
